---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="AI Dating Photo System — Dating Photo Lab"
  description="A practical system for creating realistic dating-style photos with your own face, using reference photos, prompts, and ready-to-use scenes."
>
  <main>
    <section class="product-hero">
      <div class="product-hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">AI PHOTO SYSTEM</p>

        <h1>AI Dating Photo System</h1>

        <p class="product-intro">
          A repeatable way to create dating photos with your own face, without
          starting from scratch every time.
        </p>

        <a
          class="button"
          href="https://payhip.com/b/J9Y3e"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Get the system — $14.99
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="product-introduction">
      <div class="product-introduction-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">THE IDEA</p>

        <h2>Start with your face. Then build the scene.</h2>

        <p>
          The system uses a small set of clear selfie photos as your identity
          reference, then combines that reference with scene instructions.
        </p>

        <p>
          Instead of writing every prompt from scratch, you set up your identity
          once and reuse the system across different scenes.
        </p>

        <p>
          The goal is to keep the same person consistent while changing the
          setting, activity, and mood of the photo.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="product-introduction">
      <div class="product-introduction-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">WHAT YOU NEED</p>

        <h2>A few selfies and the system.</h2>

        <div class="product-idea-list">
          <p>5–7 clear selfie photos</p>
          <p>Gemini with image generation</p>
          <p>This PDF</p>
        </div>

        <p class="product-list-note">
          Clear reference photos give the system a better starting point for
          likeness.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="product-introduction">
      <div class="product-introduction-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">HOW IT WORKS</p>

        <h2>Set it up once. Then change the scene.</h2>

        <div class="product-steps">
          <div class="product-step">
            <span>01</span>
            <p>Create your Identity Gem and upload your reference selfies.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="product-step">
            <span>02</span>
            <p>Use the Master Prompt as the foundation for each image.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="product-step">
            <span>03</span>
            <p>Choose a scene and add it to the prompt.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="product-step">
            <span>04</span>
            <p>Generate the photo and repeat with another scene.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="product-introduction">
      <div class="product-introduction-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">SCENE LIBRARY</p>

        <h2>50 ready-to-use dating scenes.</h2>

        <p>
          The system includes 50 scene blocks you can copy and use with the
          Master Prompt.
        </p>

        <p>
          The scenes cover everyday activities and settings — getting coffee,
          browsing a bookstore, walking through a city, sitting outside,
          travelling, and other moments that give you something to do.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="product-closing">
      <p class="eyebrow">ONE SMALL SHIFT</p>

      <h2>Keep the identity consistent. Let the scene change.</h2>

      <a
        class="button"
        href="https://payhip.com/b/J9Y3e"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        Get the system — $14.99
      </a>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .product-idea-list {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .product-idea-list p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .product-list-note {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted, #6f6f6f);
  }

  .product-steps {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .product-step {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2rem 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .product-step span {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted, #6f6f6f);
  }

  .product-step p {
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
